      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GIDEON MONELLI (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with 10 wins and three minors from 15 tries. Comes off a (29.46) win last time, scoring by 8 lengths in a OPEN over 520m at this track. Looks suited here and rates on top. SUNSET CALIGULA (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 4 lengths at this track in a handy 29.76 beating TATTOOED BEAST. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Capable of going well again. HURRY UP ERIC (1) is progressing well with another good run last time, placing (30.12) last time out at this track. Form here sound including four wins. Hard to knock his form from this box, unbeaten in two starts. Expected to feature again. BEZZECCHI (2) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
